Build the complete component script.

Insurance customer onboarding in Singapore, Southeast Asia: copy application_key; trim proposal_reference; classify null or empty as MISSING, a whole-string mismatch to SG[0-9]{6} as INVALID, otherwise VALID. Perform this check before uppercasing. Also output the trimmed uppercase reference, using an empty string for null, and consent_received, treating null marketing_consent as false.

All monetary values are monthly amounts in Singapore dollars (SGD). Count one issue for each of these seven conditions:
- reference_state is not VALID;
- monthly_premium is null or nonpositive;
- declared_income is null or nonpositive;
- residential_address is null or blank after trimming;
- intermediary_code does not match the exact whole-string pattern SGI[0-9]{4}, including when null;
- consent_received is false;
- both monetary inputs are positive and monthly_premium exceeds 10% of declared_income.

Set onboarding_lane to REVIEW if any issue exists; otherwise FAST_TRACK if declared_income is at least 6000 or monthly_premium is at most 100; otherwise STANDARD.

premium_tier is UNKNOWN for null, INVALID for nonpositive, HIGH at 500 or above, BASIC otherwise. income_tier is UNKNOWN for null, INVALID for nonpositive, UPPER at 6000 or above, REGULAR otherwise. residence_present means residential_address is nonblank after trimming. intermediary_verified uses the exact whole-string intermediary pattern above, without trimming or case conversion.

Component: REFORMAT.
Input 0: {"name": "InsuranceOnboardingInput", "type": "delimited", "fields": [{"name": "application_key", "type": "long", "nullable": false}, {"name": "proposal_reference", "type": "string"}, {"name": "monthly_premium", "type": "decimal"}, {"name": "declared_income", "type": "decimal"}, {"name": "marketing_consent", "type": "boolean"}, {"name": "residential_address", "type": "string"}, {"name": "intermediary_code", "type": "string"}]}
Output 0: {"name": "InsuranceOnboardingResult", "type": "delimited", "fields": [{"name": "application_key", "type": "long", "nullable": false}, {"name": "reference_state", "type": "string"}, {"name": "canonical_reference", "type": "string"}, {"name": "issue_count", "type": "integer"}, {"name": "onboarding_lane", "type": "string"}, {"name": "premium_tier", "type": "string"}, {"name": "income_tier", "type": "string"}, {"name": "residence_present", "type": "boolean"}, {"name": "intermediary_verified", "type": "boolean"}, {"name": "consent_received", "type": "boolean", "nullable": false}]}

